Health & help
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Your first review                                        │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 1. Choose Files above to read the changes.               │
│ 2. Use arrows in the focused pane; Tab switches list and │
│ diff. Enter activates; Escape goes back.                 │
│ 3. Press Space for Actions. Type a name to find tools,   │
│ then Enter to choose.                                    │
│ 4. In the diff, Enter opens a comment. Enter in the      │
│ editor posts now; Ctrl+P queues a local pending comment. │
│ 5. Choose Submit review to send your decision and        │
│ pending comments after confirmation.                     │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

↑/↓: scroll · s: all shortcuts · esc: back
